{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想要快速模糊照片背景、保護隱私或創造藝術效果？Blur Photo Editor: Face &amp; BG 是一款專為 iOS 用戶設計的智慧照片編輯工具，提供精準的人臉偵測與背景模糊功能，無論你是新手還是進階用戶，都能輕鬆製作出專業級影像。目前這款 App 正在進行終生版限時免費，原價 US $29.99 現在可以免費領取。</p>\n\n<h2>強大模糊工具與濾鏡效果</h2>\n<p>應用程式的智慧模糊工具可自動偵測人臉和主體，快速實現背景模糊、選擇性模糊或恢復清晰度；同時提供高斯模糊、散景效果、馬賽克等多種模糊風格，配合超過 100 款的濾鏡與特效，讓你的照片呈現專業質感。此外，進階編輯工具如裁剪、調色、文字疊加等，更進一步提升創作靈活性，整體工作流程流暢且易於操作。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-70-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-71-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-72-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-73-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-74-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-75-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<h2>限時免費領取終生版</h2>\n<p>Blur Photo Editor: Face &amp; BG 終生版內購限時免費中，用戶完成初始化後看到收費牆，Lifetime 價格顯示為$0 即可免費收下。注意，如果看到價格不是 $0 代表限免已完結，請勿按付費確認。</p>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4369\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_4369-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<img alt=\"IMG 4370\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/IMG_4370-473x1024.webp\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Blur Photo Editor: Face &amp; BG</li>\n<li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-16T15:38:38.216351+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":508,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}